{
  "id": "E375",
  "title": "Halloween is Coming",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-10-29",
  "synopsis": "Lili and Little Le are discussing Halloween costumes!",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50375/348cbf3187459d5062a63c5382daeeb380257bf2.mp3?1572263408",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "万圣节就要到了\n\n小乐：万圣节就要来了。\n丽丽：是啊，今年万圣节你准备扮什么？\n小乐：我觉得你去年扮女巫特别好看，所以我今年也想扮女巫。\n丽丽：好主意！我去年的衣服也可以借给你。\n小乐：真的吗？太好了！那你准备扮什么呢？\n丽丽：我打算扮小丑。",
    "traditional": "萬聖節就要到了\n\n小樂：萬聖節就要來了。\n麗麗：是啊，今年萬聖節你準備扮什麼？\n小樂：我覺得你去年扮女巫特別好看，所以我今年也想扮女巫。\n麗麗：好主意！我去年的衣服也可以借給你。\n小樂：真的嗎？太好了！那你準備扮什麼呢？\n麗麗：我打算扮小丑。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Halloween is Coming"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：万圣节就要来了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：萬聖節就要來了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wàn shèng jié jiù yào lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Halloween is coming."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：是啊，今年万圣节你准备扮什么？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：是啊，今年萬聖節你準備扮什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shì a jīn nián wàn shèng jié nǐ zhǔn bèi bàn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yeah, what are you preparing to dress up as for Halloween this year?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：我觉得你去年扮女巫特别好看，所以我今年也想扮女巫。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我覺得你去年扮女巫特別好看，所以我今年也想扮女巫。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ jué de nǐ qù nián bàn nǚ wū tè bié hǎo kàn suǒ yǐ wǒ jīn nián yě xiǎng bàn nǚ wū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I thought you looked great last year dressed up as a witch, so this year I also want to dress up as a witch."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好主意！我去年的衣服也可以借给你。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好主意！我去年的衣服也可以借給你。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo zhǔ yi wǒ qù nián de yī fu yě kě yǐ jiè gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Good idea! I can lend you my costume from last year too."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：真的吗？太好了！那你准备扮什么呢？",
      "traditional": "小樂：真的嗎？太好了！那你準備扮什麼呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhēn de ma tài hǎo le nà nǐ zhǔn bèi bàn shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Really? Great! So, what are you preparing to dress up as?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我打算扮小丑。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我打算扮小丑。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ dǎ suàn bàn xiǎo chǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I plan to dress up as a clown."
    }
  ],
